        "original_id": "e04284f6-e0af-586c-b1e7-658bd7a9ea41",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Rescuers, The Muppets, Muppets Most Wanted, Alice Through the Looking Glass, Macbeth, The Fox and the Hound\n- People: Jeanette Nolan, James Bobin\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Buena Vista Distribution\n- Topics: animated films, Muppets films, film roles, film directing\n\nFacts:\n- Macbeth is a 1948 film in which Jeanette Nolan had a role.\n- Jeanette Nolan is best known for roles in The Virginian from 1962 to 1971 and Dirty Sally in 1974.\n- The Rescuers is a 1977 American animated comedy-drama adventure film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Buena Vista Distribution first released The Rescuers on June 22, 1977.\n- Jeanette Nolan voiced Ellie Mae in The Rescuers in 1977.\n- The Fox and the Hound is a 1981 animated Disney film in which Jeanette Nolan voiced Widow Tweed.\n- The Muppets is a 2011 American musical comedy film and the seventh theatrical film featuring the Muppets.\n- James Bobin directed The Muppets in 2011, Muppets Most Wanted in 2014, and Alice Through the Looking Glass in 2016.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
